stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> Running: prompt() / steer() / followUp()
  Running --> Running: steer() / followUp() → input/queued
  Running --> Waiting: model/failed → WakeAt(retryAt)
  Waiting --> Running: wake-up timer
  Running --> Idle: run/ended completed
  Running --> Idle: abort/requested → run/ended aborted
  Running --> Idle: 3 failures → run/ended failed
  Running --> Down: the process dies
  Down --> Running: restart → fold log → decide
